  "description": "CLI security scanner for MCP (Model Context Protocol) server configurations. Detects prompt injection, tool poisoning, and supply chain vulnerabilities aligned with OWASP Agentic AI Top 10. Supports stdio, HTTP/SSE, and WebSocket transports.",
